      "summary": "The CSUDH Strategic Plan, titled 'Going Far Together,' aims to establish the university as a socially just, equitable, and inclusive model urban university. The plan is built upon the pillars of 'Learn Together' and 'Thrive Together' and commits to empowering students, faculty, and staff while fostering academic excellence and equitable access. By encouraging collaboration and innovative solutions, CSUDH intends to become a national model for a socially just and inclusive metropolitan university.",
